  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">R&#xE9;ponse en abris et AME aux besoins des personnes affect&#xE9;es par la crise M23 dans la province du Nord-Kivu</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of this project is to provide life-saving shelter and essential household item assistance to internally displaced persons and host community members in Beni, Goma, Lubero, Mweso, Nyiragongo, and Rutshuru. This UNHCR project constructs emergency shelters and community kitchens, distributes essential household item kits and hygiene kits. The project provides humanitarian assistance to 44,600 people, including 8,500 women, 7,600 men, 28,500 children, and including 500 persons with disabilities.</narrative>
  </description>
